OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with rape of girl near
OL,4,APiccadilly Gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with raping a
OL,7,F17-year-old girl in Manchester.
OL,9,FAbdul Shinwari, 24, of no fixed abode,
OL,10,Fwas charged after reports that a
OL,11,F17-year-old girl was raped on Hope
OL,12,FStreet, near Piccadilly Gardens, at
OL,13,Faround 01:30 BST on 14 July.
OL,15,FShinwari was charged with two counts of
OL,16,Frape, two counts of sexual assault,
OL,17,Fnon-fatal strangulation and possession
OL,18,Fwith intent to supply, and will appear
OL,19,Fat Manchester Crown Court on Tuesday,
OL,20,FGreater Manchester Police said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
